# GTIS ID Print Station has NO build-time settings that need secrets.
#
# Never put the device token (or any token, password or key) in a .env file:
# Vite compiles VITE_* values into the app, and release builds are public.
# The device token is entered once on the station in Device setup and stored
# encrypted by Windows (Electron safeStorage). See README.md.
#
# The portal address defaults to https://portal.gtis.edu.ph and can be changed
# in Device setup. Without device setup the app runs in sample mode.
